{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c556fd00f3adc4f1c71476d17df93bf8b308100a96adda896c162efe17bcd6c4", "ja": "青羽さん、どうしたんですか？\nなんだか今日は、ニコニコですね。", "zh": "青羽小姐，怎么了？\n总觉得你今天一直笑眯眯的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "ee73d07c936fc7117cca0236962f0046b82678da64407d98857314cc6227d0a8", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　私、\n顔に出ちゃってましたか？　恥ずかしい～……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！我是不是把心情都写在脸上了？好害羞啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "adf80bb6e9876733a680d038f32983c9d9e8c8fef579aae237336101a76de765", "ja": "実は、高校の同級生が東京に出てきてるので、\n今夜、一緒にごはんを食べにいくんです♪", "zh": "其实是高中的同班同学来东京了，\n今晚我们要一起去吃个饭♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "bd31f2a49d07ac349b3b540e6d198b9914979e7a2a7e406abaa646c46c2852e1", "ja": "久しぶりだから会うのが楽しみで♪\n学生時代の友達って、特別ですよね。", "zh": "因为很久没见了，所以很期待和她见面♪学生时代的朋友，总觉得很特别呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "872dd7265bc7d7fe3e73e1acbb5d7ce5c7f3a57aaa2c756e0bd6b489e8cb44e1", "ja": "わかる気がします。社会人になってしまうと、学生の\n頃のような友人はなかなかできないですからね。", "zh": "我能理解您的感受。开始工作后，就很难再交到像学生时代那样的朋友了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "ae419c961c3042796ce6643cc88a8e2c1b449ecf8c8b54ede41491cede5d5836", "ja": "そうそう、お泊りして、朝までおしゃべりしたり。\nどうしてあんなに話すことがあったんでしょうね。", "zh": "对对，还会一起留宿，聊到早上呢。\n真奇怪，那时候怎么会有那么多话可聊呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "e1b72a70dbc2c71cde231276d7f82690d6ab2e6ff4afd432c8624f54c065c5b6", "ja": "あ、でも社会人になっても、765プロのみんなとは\n仲良くなれたと思います♪　この間も……、あ！！", "zh": "啊，不过就算参加工作了，我也觉得和765制作人们相处得很好♪ 前阵子也……啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ad469e298f39bd28fd3610ed3d6d045fa313968b90ae9067e38cbb4bdf6d6283", "ja": "どうしました？", "zh": "有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "5a5f0a9d2807fede3db7c0a324e91f6115e2c33752daa5159294ed80a6bd7960", "ja": "それで思い出しました！　じつは私……\n社長さんから、秘密の伝言を言付かってたんです。", "zh": "这么一说我想起来了！其实我……\n社长先生还托我带来了一段秘密口信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3ca44f47db8763514d849df53bfcc9497e60550453367db8edf3364610da3a48", "ja": "えっ、秘密の伝言……？", "zh": "咦，秘密的口信……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "b41ad67f8345b49ddd06d5d085ce6f6bf1fad77328830524a8c5446ad0c178dc", "ja": "はい。「例の秘密の案件のことでね」って\nおっしゃっていたので、秘密みたいです……！", "zh": "是的。因为他说了“关于之前那个秘密的委托”，所以应该是秘密吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2dbcc0e3c1fe71284bc27c19de50c25e6bd788c428861305c2d9ad38292681da", "ja": "例の秘密の案件……ああ、なるほど。\nたぶんそれ、そんなに秘密じゃないですよ。", "zh": "那个秘密的委托……啊，原来如此。\n我觉得那大概没那么秘密。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "9aceecd2823d9d68cd8f0c9a797312dbd5a963e6bb13796ef69f4c46051b0643", "ja": "えっ！　そうなんですか？\nそっかぁ……。", "zh": "诶！是这样吗？\n这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "34e1dbc2efceaf33cab26da83bfe40f7e237b18db4b783de437719954bbbbffe", "ja": "とにかく、今から行ってきますね。\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "总之，我现在就过去看看。\n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "ec5ceef489dc157de5fc1579b2920d2916c14cee87fcfd44871735c13424642f", "ja": "あ、はーい！　……はっ、念のため……。\nいってらっしゃ～い……。", "zh": "啊，好——！……啊，保险起见……  \n路上小心哦～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "673d5dd39a2b7746015d4cb961a8df640c43ae71f96a83cbcd0463f698ec337a", "ja": "話というのは、この間のオーディションの\nことでね。今朝、結果が届いたんだよ。", "zh": "说的是前阵子那次试镜的事。\n今早收到结果了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0a6c64efe36517ab41f10d731cc16b4ac74ed156332c961808097274124c31fb", "ja": "それじゃ、やっぱり貴音と風花が受けたドラマ\n『秘密のメモリーズ』のオーディションですね。", "zh": "那么，果然是贵音和风花参加的电视剧《秘密的回忆》的试镜吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "40b36c9030ba5c2258beafc2155fee636693532ff0446caa6a2f294af0dcb7d0", "ja": "トップクラスの俳優も受けていたので\nなかなか厳しそうでしたが……。", "zh": "因为顶尖演员也参加了试镜，看起来相当严峻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "4c9db9fa0318c9e56c20cd729c6ebd74d37572e42f36de5ec45d9f180c6f8242", "ja": "ふむふむ……。\n「『秘密のメモリーズ』オーディション用資料」", "zh": "嗯嗯……\n“《秘密的回忆》试镜资料”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "ce3ff479f040021174785129c38a995922d0a28347dd94875ad2bfdaa3ad7b07", "ja": "「夕貴乃（ゆきの）と帆風（ほのか）。高校時代に\n同級生だった社会人女子2人の恋模様を描くドラマ」", "zh": "「夕贵乃与帆风。描绘曾是高中\n同班同学的2名职场女性恋爱模样的电视剧」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "77e1c4fcc9fede42138f8f95cbfd6eac8159d2d24a6bf2bd7e1c467eb96d161a", "ja": "「監督　桜木ゆう」！？　……えーっ！\nこれって、桜木ゆう監督の最新作ってことですか！？", "zh": "“导演 樱木悠”！？……欸——！\n这难道是说，这是樱木悠导演的最新作品吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "73dfca6bcb5b9d1f6f2e10897aa1322807a65be13ad7d350046bd89da3d5b8fa", "ja": "はい。オーディションの時にご挨拶させて\nいただきました。ご存じなんですか？", "zh": "是的。试镜的时候曾向您打过招呼。您认识他吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "f40c32957e395fd53f7c2ff00bd40ffb6f5bc2107bd2a81a5098ff406ef2de1e", "ja": "ご存じというか、大ファンなんです！\n前作のドラマもよかったなぁ……♪", "zh": "与其说是知道，不如说我是她的超级粉丝！\n上一部作品的剧情也很棒呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "79112c6802f1df8e182e0bd3cdccba8e2dc7d4878f1eba7b51993b87be4ac9e0", "ja": "女性監督だけに、女性の心理描写がお上手で。\nいちいち、わかりみが深くって……♪", "zh": "正因为是女导演，对女性心理的描写才格外精湛。\n每一处都让人深有同感呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "58bf703e654cb26a0f80e5e8be204d64fffb763dd4ca98134e2fdc0268d23f98", "ja": "なるほど。人気と聞いていましたが、コアなファンも\n多そうですね……。あの、それで二人の結果は？", "zh": "原来如此。我听说她们很有人气，看来核心粉丝也不少呢……那个，两位的结果怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "d2aeac4388115f31cac0fcedccb2ec1523814e431d3d2ae928968f938e86f990", "ja": "うむ。……四条君、豊川君、ともに合格だ！", "zh": "嗯。……四条同学、丰川同学，你们都合格了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7ba414e9e42f60aa2afbb839c1614d7ab3bf22bfd3317d7958bd1fc3fc62b67a", "ja": "おお、本当ですか！？", "zh": "哦，真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "2a0617baf51bd093f625bba683cbfabdc9a74c248d6a1909a1ccc625309cf830", "ja": "よかった～！\nやりましたね、{$P$}さん！！", "zh": "太好了～！\n真棒呢，{$P$}先生！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c6a5cb3b466116f88f9b6e7443b08cc92c23ca76ede390b8fa06b3f552fc033f", "ja": "は、はい。本人たちも頑張ったとはいえ、本当に\n選んでいただけるとは。ありがたいです！", "zh": "是、是的。虽然她们本人也很努力，但没想到真的会被选中。实在是太感激了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "3a1e4215ddcc5f871dd00aff470088f0921be781016e943901d5272d8846ed2c", "ja": "今回のドラマも、人々に愛される作品になるといいね。\n期待しているよ！", "zh": "这次的剧也希望能成为一部受人们喜爱的作品呢。\n我很期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1031_101kot", "source_sha256": "c053400b06d9c6e44071bbc155bbf9ecb8d94d0dc299faf058bf35a373a14a43", "ja": "私も、期待しています！　……期待しています！！", "zh": "我也很期待！……真的非常期待！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "8584a02d595d2aadedf98d6b56ac5cbcdd0edd3b5457cb19d395570266654efa", "ja": "（『秘密のメモリーズ』……。貴音と風花の\n繊細な感性を活かしてもらえるといいな）", "zh": "（《秘密的回忆》……希望能充分展现贵音和风花细腻的感性）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
